 .topbar-user{margin-inline-start:auto}
 
-/* Pass 6: collapsible sidebar redesign — jasmine brand mark, grouped nav
-   sections, floating re-open toggle when minimized (was: PersistentSidebar.razor
-   inline style). Supersedes the flat .sidebar-nav a list styled above; the
-   markup now renders .sidebar-group / .sidebar-group-toggle / .sidebar-group-items
-   instead. Old .sidebar-nav a rules are kept because AuthorizeView/NavLink
